# Test files should never ship in a deployment. This matters beyond hygiene:
# a *.test.ts file living directly under api/ (not under an underscore-
# prefixed dir like api/_lib/) gets picked up by Vercel's zero-config
# function detection just like a real route handler, which can silently
# push a deployment over the Hobby plan's 12-function cap (see CLAUDE.md
# §10's note on that cap — this bit us for real with api/templates/index.test.ts).
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
